<title>PORTUGAL: Jeronimo Martins shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Jeronimo Martins shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share trade in Portuguese retailer Jeronimo Martins was suspended on Thursday, a Lisbon bourse spokesman said.</p>
<p>The spokesman said that the bourse was seeking a clarification from the company about a press report. He gave no further details.</p>
</text>
